{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong><br>This free <strong>Dawn Watcher Demo</strong> lets you experience the opening battles of the full game. Step into the role of the Hero King, defend your kingdom against invading armies and night-born creatures, and test your tactical skills in large-scale confrontations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s included in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Maps \u00b7 14 Stages</strong>: Each map has 7 progressive battles to challenge your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 14 Units to Unlock</strong>: Experience a portion of the unit roster, each with unique skills and counter mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Combat &amp; Base Defense</strong>: Take command as the Hero King, defend your base, summon troops, and lead them in decisive battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Deployment</strong>: Purchase and arrange troops, combine formations, and prepare for the enemy\u2019s final assault.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s in the Full Version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Maps \u00b7 70+ Stages</strong> across 12 kingdoms with a complete campaign storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26 Unique Units</strong> fully unlockable with advanced counter mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Rival King Battles</strong> and large-scale wars with evolving strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional modes, including the planned <strong>Custom Mode</strong> for creating your own battles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631530?t=1757335934","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631530?t=1757335934","capsule_image":"htt